  "placement": "Book page 40, topic 2.5: দ্রুতি এবং বেগ. Next to the section text (100 m in 20 s → 5 m/s; 50 m of displacement in 20 s → 2.5 m/s in that direction).",
  "order": 1,
  "maintainers": ["RadeenXALNW"],
  "units": "m",
  "description": "Speed and velocity (দ্রুতি এবং বেগ, page 40, 2.5) with two boys on a plain field who run for the same 20 s. Boy 1 runs a zig-zag path: the panel works out দ্রুতি = দূরত্ব ÷ সময় = 100 m ÷ 20 s = 5 m/s, a number with no direction. Boy 2 runs 50 m straight along an outlined বেগ arrow whose angle from east is shown: বেগ = সরণ ÷ সময় = 50 m ÷ 20 s = 2.5 m/s, with its direction (angle and compass word). The student taps দৌড়াও and turns boy 2's direction (◀ ▶, the arrow keys, or by dragging the arrow). Test: 5 tap questions (the direction of boy 2's velocity, speed or velocity from book-style numbers, which quantity is a vector, same speed but different velocity, the average velocity of a run back to the start). Phone-first, Bangla. GLB: the field, the two boys and the arrow; 1 unit is drawn for 5 m.",
  "tags": ["motion", "speed", "velocity", "vector", "displacement", "distance", "bangla"],
